#: templates/summarizer/about.html:7
msgid "About Our AI-Powered arXiv Paper Summarization Service"
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:9
msgid ""
"Learn more about our innovative AI-powered arXiv paper summarization "
"service. Find out how our team of experts leverages cutting-edge "
"technologies to deliver fast, accurate, and easy-to-read paper summaries."
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:23
msgid "About Us"
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:24
msgid ""
"Welcome to our website, where we use cutting-edge AI technology to summarize "
"the latest research papers from arXiv. Our goal is to make it easy for you "
"to stay up-to-date on the latest developments in your field of interest, "
"without having to spend hours reading through lengthy research papers. It "
"can also be useful if you are not a researcher but want to understand the "
"content of published articles in a certain field. Everyone has the ability "
"to verify information, thereby reducing the spread of misinformation. We "
"wish to thank arXiv for use of its open access interoperability."
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:26
msgid "How We Do It"
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:27
msgid ""
"Our AI algorithms analyze each paper and extract the key findings and "
"conclusions, presenting them to you in a concise and easily digestible "
"format. By automating this process, we are able to provide you with an AI "
"assistant to answer your questions about the content of articles in a "
"fraction of the time it would take you to read them all in their entirety. "
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:29
msgid "Our Team"
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:30
msgid ""
"The team is currently made up of one researcher in astrophysics (Quentin "
"Kral) with a passion to make complex information more accessible. Our goal "
"is to allow everyone to benefit from all research findings and thereby avoid "
"fake news."
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:34 templates/summarizer/arxividpage.html:689
msgid "Disclaimer:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/summarizer/about.html:34 templates/summarizer/arxividpage.html:689
msgid ""
"The AI-based summarization tool and virtual assistant provided on this "
"website may not always provide accurate and complete summaries or responses. "
"We encourage you to carefully review and evaluate the generated content to "
"ensure its quality and relevance to your needs."
msgstr ""

